// Sheet range is Touch, but "touch a mundane weapon" reads naturally as the
// caster enchanting their own held weapon -- unlike this batch's ally-facing
// Touch spells (`barkskin.ron`/`dragons_breath.ron`), there is no third-person
// "the touched creature" framing here, so this stays a plain `SelfBuff`
// (caster benefits), no `InGroup`-melee redirect needed.
// `BuffKind::Reckless` (`common/src/comp/buff.rs`: "Increases both attack
// damage and vulnerability to damage") is the only existing buff that grants
// a flat attack-damage bonus to the wielder's own strikes, matching the
// sheet's "strikes truer and bites deeper" flavor. Reckless's paired
// vulnerability increase isn't in the sheet's description but is Reckless's
// only shape in this engine; flagged as a deviation, not a silent
// reinterpretation.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Reckless, data: BuffData(strength: 0.15, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 40,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Transmutation),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 2 spell -> min_level 12, same `level * 6` convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(12)),
    ),
)
